<%# The Letterboxd mark, wherever a film is on screen. Takes a url and a name rather than
    an Entry: watch_now plays films the app has no Entry for.

    The url points back at the app so the film's canonical slug can be resolved -- only
    /film/<slug>/review/ opens the review prompt -- and so a diary refresh can be booked
    for once the review has had time to reach the feed. %>
<a href="<%= url %>"
   target="_blank"
   rel="noopener noreferrer"
   class="letterboxd-link"
   title="Review <%= name %> on Letterboxd"
   aria-label="Review <%= name %> on Letterboxd">
  <i class="fa-brands fa-square-letterboxd"></i>
</a>
